Variables in js

-> Variables are containers for data
-> Js is 'Dynamically Typed' main that no use of the DataType you can use the Variables.
-> in the Variables we can add
   example:-
   name1,      name2,      name3
   full_Name   fullName_   _fullName
   age$        $age        full$Age 

-> Reserved words(key words) cannot be Variables names
-> In Variables name should be in the 'camel case'
  example:-
  fullName, fullAge, studName.
  
 -------------------------------------------- 
Now using of the 'Key Words'
 -var, const, let.

--var
 -Variable can be re-declared & update. A globle scope variable
 -var is the old use in the year 2015
 syntex:-
  var name="ali";

--let
 -Variable cannot be re-declared biut can updated.A block scope variable.
 -let is the new to use 
 syntex:-
  let name="ali";

--const
 -Variable cannot be re-declared or update. A block scope Variable.
 -const is also new to js and const Variable cannot be change in the js like final
 syntex:-
  const name="ali";

